<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Ikey Dweck is a rare individual within our community. He is one of now a few Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim alumni attending law school. His story is one about paying attention to your own progress, consistent growth, and utilizing that growth to build an incredibly solid future for the years and decades to come. Once he graduates, he will make an excellent lawyer. He is an outstanding example of the type of alumni Yeshivat Moreshet Yerushalayim strives to build.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
